"css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "931e4b6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "05", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c419937", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Nenajde vás Google", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d667d8a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Na důležité fráze se web neukazuje.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "43e447b", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "73d8fc2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "06", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "fb0e185", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Zastaralý vzhled", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "3b5e55a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Web působí jako z jiné doby a podkopává důvěru.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "2daa6a8", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "4bf10a1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "07", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c2344d5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Chybí GDPR a cookies", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1be9c94", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Starý web nesplňuje dnešní požadavky na souhlas s cookies.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "d0f9075", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "6ca1954", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "08", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a4530a1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Chcete víc", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0bd1d06", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Rezervace, jazyky nebo e-shop, které starý web neumí.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "e441541", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "detail"}, "elements": [{"id": "f76785a", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-legal-wrap ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "eed26b3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Jak probíhá redesign webu", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e1401dd", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Začínáme auditem: projdeme obsah, strukturu, návštěvnost a to, na co se web ve vyhledávání ukazuje. Poté navrhneme novou strukturu, připravíme texty a design. Nový web spustíme tak, aby staré adresy vedly na nové stránky.</p><h3>Redesign webu bez ztráty pozic</h3><p>Největší riziko redesignu je ztráta návštěvnosti z Googlu. Proto mapujeme staré adresy, nastavujeme přesměrování a po spuštění kontrolujeme Search Console.</p><h3>Redesign, nebo úplně nový web?</h3><p>Pokud je současný web na WordPressu a obsah je v pořádku, často stačí nový design a úprava struktury. Pokud ne, postavíme <a href=\"/tvorba-webu-na-miru/\">nový web na míru</a> a obsah převedeme.</p><h3>Kolik stojí redesign webu</h3><p>Cena závisí na rozsahu webu a množství obsahu k převodu. Orientační přehled najdete na stránce <a href=\"/kolik-stoji-web/\">Kolik stojí web</a>, přesnou nabídku připravíme zdarma.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-legaltext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "54f0e3f", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "reference"}, "elements": [{"id": "5582498", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "91f61f2", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "aaddda5", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "21a2fb0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Reference", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "22e85ac", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Weby, na které jsme hrdí.", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "6f5023e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Výběr realizací. Celé portfolio webů, e-shopů a kampaní najdete na Yesmark.eu.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "c0c1e55", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-refs", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "23fe8f5", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "002641d", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "055f0c1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 28, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-konradt-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Konradt", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1d7c889", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "fa5367e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "01e19a8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · CNC obrábění", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4aea5a9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Konradt", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e592c23", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro společnost KONRADT jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na profesionální prezentaci služeb v oblasti CNC obrábění, montáže a zpracování kovů. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní technický vzhled, přehledné představení výrobních možností společnosti a srozumitelnou prezentaci jednotlivých služeb.</p><p>Součástí realizace byla také optimalizace struktury a obsahu webu s ohledem na vyhledávače a lepší dohledatelnost služeb v oblasti CNC frézování, CNC soustružení, montážních prací a dodávek odlitků.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "278d192", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "konradt.cz", "link": {"url": "https://www.konradt.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "7508cea", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "4283435", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "540708e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 29, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-monika-velickova-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Monika Veličková", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "24da173", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "346687e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "cb145b2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Reality Jeseníky", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "cd81501", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Monika Veličková", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "ba13ff3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro realitní makléřku Moniku Veličkovou jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na prezentaci nemovitostí a realitních služeb v Jeseníkách. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní a osobitý design, přehlednou prezentaci nabízených nemovitostí a především na budování osobní značky, která staví na znalosti regionu, individuálním přístupu a zkušenostech s realitami i investicemi.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7fac72d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "monikavelickova.cz", "link": {"url": "https://monikavelickova.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "00c8085", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "e72b78f", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "80a0cda", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 27, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-brincil-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Břinčil", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "cf27603", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "4fedb4c", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "b926a27", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Technika a služby", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b29d161", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Břinčil", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "108bba2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"ed